  message: "OWNER RULING 2026-11-20: APPROVED. Add scripts/repin-line-citations --check to .githooks/pre-commit (when a staged file is cited by the module_key_axis or signature_axis registries), in PR 6; ship via auto-pr WITHOUT --gov (owner-approved governance change, like INV-kosok)."  # a03d
